  Algorithm and default parameters by the Open Spaced Repetition community
  https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition
  HugMun contains an independent implementation of FSRS-6, written from the
  published specification and adapted for this population; see
  engine/scheduling/src/main/kotlin/com/hugmun/engine/scheduling/Fsrs.kt and
  docs/adr/0005-reimplement-fsrs.md. No code was copied. Attribution is given
  because the algorithm is their work.

